      "message": "Just drive-by. I\u0027m curious why it\u0027s ok to use `shared_ptr` and `weak_ptr` here? I thought it\u0027s banned (based on Chrome\u0027s C++ guidelines) and that\u0027s reason we implemented `WeakRef` class in Dawn.",
